# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# You do NOT need this file to run the demo. With no .env.local at all it boots
# in mock mode: a local stand-in widget that consumes the same signed URL,
# verifies the HMAC the way Onramper does, and fires real signed webhooks at the
# receiver. Everything downstream of the widget is the production code path.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# mock    (default) local mock widget, no credentials, full lifecycle
# preview real buy.onramper.com widget via the public API key in Onramper's own
#         docs. Production key: card entry is REAL MONEY. Wallet params can't be
#         signed without the matching secret, so the destination is NOT locked
#         and is omitted; webhooks go to that key's owner, so the invoice only
#         advances via the simulators. For looking at the real UI, nothing else.
# live    your own key and secrets. The only mode where the address lock and the
#         webhooks are yours. Falls back to mock if the three vars below are unset.
ONRAMPER_MODE=mock

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Live mode only. All three are issued by Onramper during onboarding - there is
# no self-serve signup and no public sandbox key. Ask your Onramper contact for:
#   1. a sandbox API key (pk_test_...)
#   2. the widget URL signing secret  (separate from the API key)
#   3. the webhook signing secret     (separate again)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ONRAMPER_API_KEY=pk_test_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# ONRAMPER_SIGNING_SECRET=
# ONRAMPER_WEBHOOK_SECRET=

# Optional override of the env inferred from the key prefix: sandbox | production
# ONRAMPER_ENV=sandbox

# Public base URL of THIS app. Used for the mock widget origin and for the
# success/failure redirect targets.
APP_BASE_URL=http://localhost:3000

# Comma-separated provider allowlist (onlyOnramps). Banxa has the most mature
# sandbox - use EUR or GBP. Leave empty to show every provider.
# ONRAMPER_ONLY_ONRAMPS=banxa

# /api/dev/* simulator routes. Default on outside live mode. Never true in production.
# ENABLE_DEV_SIMULATORS=false
